    "Cost": 1720196,
    "UIName": "Yu Huang",
    "Id": "chassisdef_yu_huang_Y-H11F",
    "Name": "Yu Huang",
    "Details": "The Yu Huang Y-H11F has a mixed weapons loadout, aimed to cover most ranges of engagement. For long rang attacks, the 'Mech carries an ER PPC and LRM-10. Two ER Medium Lasers cover medium range, and as the foes get closer an Ultra AC/20 is ready to finish them off.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Command Mech</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.16</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Upper, Right Upper</color>",
